{"actor":"ndmikkelsen","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-03-02T05:04:21Z","event_type":"updated","id":159,"issue_id":"flashloaner-zh3","new_value":"{\"notes\":\"Superseded by flashloaner-qef in v0.2.0 Live Optimization epic\"}","old_value":"{\"id\":\"flashloaner-zh3\",\"title\":\"Investigate and fix static gas estimate fallback accuracy\",\"description\":\"NodeInterface precompile call for L1 data fee estimation is failing in live mode ([GAS] NodeInterface call failed, using static estimates). Static fallback may be inaccurate for actual transaction sizes, affecting profit calculations. Needs investigation of why NodeInterface call fails and whether static estimates are conservative enough.\",\"status\":\"open\",\"priority\":2,\"issue_type\":\"bug\",\"owner\":\"natem12@gmail.com\",\"created_at\":\"2026-02-26T22:49:54Z\",\"created_by\":\"ndmikkelsen\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-02-26T22:49:54Z\"}"}
{"actor":"ndmikkelsen","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-03-02T05:04:22Z","event_type":"status_changed","id":160,"issue_id":"flashloaner-l4f","new_value":"{\"status\":\"in_progress\"}","old_value":"{\"id\":\"flashloaner-l4f\",\"title\":\"[epic] v0.2.0 Live Optimization\",\"description\":\"Epic covering all 10 issues identified from live bot log analysis. Goal: make the Arbitrum mainnet bot profitable by fixing gas estimation, tuning thresholds, cleaning up zombie processes, improving logging, and fixing the profit calculation pipeline. Issues: (1) zombie shadow processes, (2) 1GB log files with no rotation, (3) NodeInterface gas estimation broken, (4) 'no profitable input size' 95.6% of rejections, (5) profit threshold 7.5x above reality, (6) low wallet balance, (7) same pairs rejected every cycle, (8) gross profit returning zero, (9) RPC CALL_EXCEPTION errors, (10) 5 ETH input too large for thin pools.\",\"status\":\"open\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"epic\",\"owner\":\"natem12@gmail.com\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-02T05:01:37Z\",\"created_by\":\"ndmikkelsen\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-02T05:01:37Z\"}"}
{"actor":"ndmikkelsen","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-03-02T05:23:23Z","event_type":"status_changed","id":161,"issue_id":"flashloaner-i9g","new_value":"{\"status\":\"in_progress\"}","old_value":"{\"id\":\"flashloaner-i9g\",\"title\":\"Kill zombie shadow processes and add process guard to run-bot.sh\",\"description\":\"4 stale shadow bot instances from Feb 26 are still running (PIDs 18351, 19422, 20286, 25102), consuming RPC credits continuously for 3+ days. Fix: (1) Kill the stale processes now, (2) Add PID file management to run-bot.sh so it kills previous instances on startup, (3) Add a 'stop' subcommand to run-bot.sh. BDD: Create feature spec for process lifecycle management.\",\"status\":\"open\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"bug\",\"owner\":\"natem12@gmail.com\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-02T05:03:12Z\",\"created_by\":\"ndmikkelsen\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-02T05:03:12Z\"}"}
{"actor":"ndmikkelsen","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-03-02T05:23:23Z","event_type":"status_changed","id":162,"issue_id":"flashloaner-6c7","new_value":"{\"status\":\"in_progress\"}","old_value":"{\"id\":\"flashloaner-6c7\",\"title\":\"Implement log rotation and clean up 1GB of stale /tmp logs\",\"description\":\"Bot logs in /tmp total 1,057 MB with no rotation. Current session generates ~11K lines/min at DEBUG level. Fix: (1) Delete old /tmp/flashbot-*.log files older than 24h, (2) Add log rotation to run-bot.sh (max 50MB per file, keep 3 rotations), (3) Consider raising default LOG_LEVEL from debug to info for production, (4) Add a max-age cleanup on startup. BDD: Create feature spec for log management.\",\"status\":\"open\",\"priority\":2,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"owner\":\"natem12@gmail.com\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-02T05:03:16Z\",\"created_by\":\"ndmikkelsen\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-02T05:03:16Z\"}"}
{"actor":"ndmikkelsen","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-03-02T05:25:57Z","event_type":"closed","id":163,"issue_id":"flashloaner-i9g","new_value":"Zombie processes killed, PID management added to run-bot.sh, log rotation implemented, old logs cleaned up. Committed in 7bcea2f.","old_value":""}
{"actor":"ndmikkelsen","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-03-02T05:25:57Z","event_type":"closed","id":164,"issue_id":"flashloaner-6c7","new_value":"Zombie processes killed, PID management added to run-bot.sh, log rotation implemented, old logs cleaned up. Committed in 7bcea2f.","old_value":""}
{"actor":"ndmikkelsen","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-03-02T05:26:02Z","event_type":"status_changed","id":165,"issue_id":"flashloaner-dej","new_value":"{\"status\":\"in_progress\"}","old_value":"{\"id\":\"flashloaner-dej\",\"title\":\"Lower profit threshold from 0.012 to match actual opportunity economics\",\"description\":\"Configured threshold is 0.012 ETH (0.016 for TJ LB with 1.33x multiplier), but the best net profit seen is only 0.001593 ETH — 7.5x below threshold. Even with perfect gas estimation, current Arbitrum spreads don't produce 0.012 ETH net on 5 ETH input. Fix: (1) Analyze historical delta data to determine realistic profit expectations, (2) Lower minProfitThreshold in arbitrum.ts to ~0.003 ETH (still covers worst-case revert gas of ~0.001 ETH on Arbitrum), (3) Add env var override so threshold can be tuned without code changes, (4) Consider dynamic threshold based on recent gas costs. BDD: Create feature spec for threshold configuration. Located in bot/src/config/chains/arbitrum.ts line 84.\",\"status\":\"open\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"owner\":\"natem12@gmail.com\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-02T05:03:20Z\",\"created_by\":\"ndmikkelsen\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-02T05:03:20Z\"}"}
{"actor":"ndmikkelsen","comment":null,"created_at":"2026-03-02T05:26:02Z","event_type":"status_changed","id":166,"issue_id":"flashloaner-4wo","new_value":"{\"status\":\"in_progress\"}","old_value":"{\"id\":\"flashloaner-4wo\",\"title\":\"Debug and fix profit function returning gross profit of exactly zero\",\"description\":\"30 entries in historical logs show (Gross: 0.000000 | Gas: 0.000000 | L1: 0.000000) — the profit function returns 0 for some paths. This suggests: (1) Reserve data missing for some V3 pools (computeVirtualReserve returns undefined), (2) V3 virtual reserve math (L/sqrtP) may overflow or underflow for certain price ranges, (3) The constant-product AMM formula may not apply to concentrated liquidity pools. Fix: Add null checks and fallback logic when reserve data is unavailable, validate profit function against eth_call simulation. BDD: Create feature spec for profit calculation correctness. Located in bot/src/detector/OpportunityDetector.ts and bot/src/optimizer/InputOptimizer.ts.\",\"status\":\"open\",\"priority\":2,\"issue_type\":\"bug\",\"owner\":\"natem12@gmail.com\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-02T05:03:22Z\",\"created_by\":\"ndmikkelsen\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-03-02T05:03:22Z\"}"}
